.Dd October 14, 2026
.Dt KEEPAWAKE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm keepawake
.Nd keep a Mac awake with IOKit power assertions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm start
.Op options
.Nm
.Cm stop
.Op Fl -agent | Fl -daemon
.Nm
.Cm resume
.Op Fl -agent | Fl -daemon
.Nm
.Cm status
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -keepawake-only
.Nm
.Cm install
.Op Fl -daemon | Fl -agent
.Op options
.Nm
.Cm uninstall
.Op Fl -purge
.Nm
.Cm schedule
.Ar specification
.Nm
.Cm config
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
holds IOKit power assertions so a Mac does not idle sleep. It can run in the foreground, or install a per-user LaunchAgent or a system LaunchDaemon. Managed preferences in the
.Sy com.keepawake
domain let an MDM cap duration and publish a default weekly schedule.
.Pp
If IOKit cannot create an assertion,
.Nm
falls back to
.Xr caffeinate 8
unless
.Fl -backend Ar iokit
was requested.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Cm start
Hold an assertion until the selected condition ends. Control-C releases it.
.It Cm stop
Signal recorded KeepAwake processes and unload launchd jobs. Plists stay on disk.
.It Cm resume
Load installed plists with
.Xr launchctl 1
.Cm bootstrap .
.It Cm status
Show KeepAwake jobs, session files, and
.Xr pmset 1
assertions.
.It Cm install
Write a launchd plist and bootstrap it.
.It Cm uninstall
Bootout the job and delete the plist. Add
.Fl -purge
to delete the copied binary.
.It Cm schedule
Explain a weekly schedule and print the next transition.
.It Cm config
Print the effective preferences, including managed preferences.
.El
.Sh MODES
Pass at most one mode. With no mode,
.Cm start
holds indefinitely and
.Cm install
uses
.Sy DefaultSchedule
when that key is set.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl -indefinite
Hold until the process is interrupted.
.It Fl -duration Ar value
Hold for a duration such as
.Ar 45m ,
.Ar 2h ,
.Ar 90s ,
or
.Ar 1h30m .
A bare number is seconds.
.It Fl -until Ar time
Hold until a clock time or a calendar time. Examples:
.Ar 17:30 ,
.Ar 5:30pm ,
.Ar 2026-10-14T18:00 .
A clock time that has already passed today rolls to tomorrow.
.It Fl -while-app Ar name
Hold while an application name matches a running process or a
.Pa .app
bundle name. Example:
.Ar zoom.us .
.It Fl -while-process Ar name
Hold while a process with this exact name is running.
.It Fl -while-pid Ar pid
Hold while that process id is alive.
.It Fl -schedule Ar spec
Weekly windows. Example:
.Ar "Mon-Fri 09:00-17:00" .
The end time is exclusive.
.Ar 00:00-24:00
covers a full day. A range such as
.Ar 22:00-06:00
crosses midnight. Separate extra windows with a semicolon.
.El
.Sh ASSERTIONS
With no assertion flags, KeepAwake prevents idle display sleep and idle system sleep.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl d , Fl -display
Prevent idle display sleep.
.It Fl i , Fl -idle-system
Prevent idle system sleep.
.It Fl s , Fl -system
Prevent system sleep while on a power adapter.
.It Fl m , Fl -disk
Prevent disk idle sleep.
.It Fl u , Fl -user-activity
Declare user activity.
.It Fl -reason Ar text
Name stored on the assertion.
.It Fl -backend Ar auto|iokit|caffeinate
Choose the implementation.
.It Fl -dry-run
Print the plan or plist and do not change the system.
.It Fl -json
Write JSON to stdout.
.El
.Sh INSTALL
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl -agent
Per-user LaunchAgent. This is the default. The plist is written under
.Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents .
.It Fl -daemon
System LaunchDaemon. Requires root. The plist is written under
.Pa /Library/LaunchDaemons .
.It Fl -user Ar name
Console user for an agent installed as root.
.It Fl -label Ar label
launchd label. Defaults to
.Sy com.keepawake.agent
or
.Sy com.keepawake.daemon .
.It Fl -no-copy
Point launchd at
.Fl -binary
instead of copying the executable into Application Support.
.It Fl -keep-alive
Restart the job if it exits.
.It Fl -no-keep-alive
Leave the job unloaded after it exits.
.It Fl -purge
On uninstall, also delete the copied binary.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.keepawake.agent.plist
Per-user job.
.It Pa /Library/LaunchDaemons/com.keepawake.daemon.plist
System job.
.It Pa ~/Library/Application Support/KeepAwake/
Copied user binary and session files.
.It Pa /Library/Application Support/KeepAwake/
Copied daemon binary and root session files.
.It Pa ~/Library/Logs/KeepAwake/
Agent logs.
.It Pa /Library/Logs/KeepAwake/
Daemon logs.
.It Pa /Library/Managed Preferences/com.keepawake.plist
Machine managed preferences.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It 0
Success. Stop, resume, and uninstall also return 0 when there is nothing to do.
.It 1
Usage or another general error.
.It 2
Managed preferences denied the request.
.It 3
The power assertion could not be created.
.It 4
A launchd operation failed, or root was required.
.It 5
A requested process id was not running.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr caffeinate 8 ,
.Xr launchctl 1 ,
.Xr pmset 1
